# Camera-control role (docs/RUNTIME_SPLIT_2026-09-28.md): API, gphoto2, metering, focus evidence.
# No mcp or astral: only server.py (the MCP server) uses them; it opens the camera itself
# and does not run on the puck.
# No torch/open_clip here: the control process refuses them (backend/runtime_roles.py).
fastapi
uvicorn[standard]
defusedxml
gphoto2
pillow
numpy
# Headless build: the board has no display; the cv2 API used here is identical.
opencv-python-headless
# RAW develop runs in control as a bounded child (isolated_raw.py spawns this venv's python).
rawpy
